/*Updated Insight:
Oracle 23ai's transpiler is more flexible than older versions — it appears to allow:

Use of simple local variables

Use of SQL-safe built-in functions like initcap

Basic case expressions

However, it still avoids transpilation when:

There are nested functions

Exception handling is present

PL/SQL-only logic or non-deterministic features are used
*/